#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "GuidePageString:153:0:0"
msgid "Stacks of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lemure Shroud</ui-edge-color></ui-color> can be consumed to execute <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Void Reaping</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Communio</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (acquired at level 90)."
msgstr "Заряды <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>покрова лемура</ui-edge-color></ui-color> можно потратить на действия <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Жатва пустоты</ui-edge-color></ui-color> и <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Коммунио</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (доступно с 90-го уровня)."

#. ja: アクション<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「ブラッドソイル」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>を実行すると、自身にステータス<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「ブラッドソイル」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>が付与されます。この効果中のみ、<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>“ソイル”</ui-edge-color></ui-color>を最大4個まで蓄積可能です。<br>さらに、Lv88で特性<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「ソイルチャージ効果アップ」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>を修得すると、「ブラッドソイル」効果中に蓄積できるソイルの上限が6個に増加します。
#. de: Mit dem Kommando <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Blutpatronen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> kannst du dir den gleichnamigen Status gewähren. Während der Wirkungsdauer von <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Blutpatronen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> erhöht sich deine Maximalanzahl an Erda-Patronen auf 4. Wird dazu noch die Eigenschaft <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Verbesserte Erda-Patronen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (Stufe 88) erlernt, so erhöht <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Blutpatronen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> die Maximalanzahl an Erda-Patronen auf 6.
#. fr: L'action <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Cartouche de sang</ui-edge-color></ui-color> vous octroie l'effet du même nom, qui augmente le nombre maximum de cartouches d'éther à quatre.<br>Après l'obtention du trait <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Chargement de cartouches amélioré</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (nv 88), vous pouvez même avoir jusqu'à six cartouches d'éther en réserve.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "GuidePageString:157:0:0"
msgid "Execution of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bloodfest</ui-edge-color></ui-color> will grant an affect that increases the maximum number of cartridges to 4. Upon learning the trait <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Cartridge Charge II</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (acquired at level 88), <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bloodfest</ui-edge-color></ui-color> will increase the maximum number of cartridges to 6."
msgstr "Использование <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Кровавого пира</ui-edge-color></ui-color> даёт эффект, увеличивающий максимум патронов до четырёх. После изучения особенности <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Заряд патронов II»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (доступно с 88-го уровня) <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Кровавый пир</ui-edge-color></ui-color> увеличит максимум патронов до шести."

